{% doc %}
  Small Talk product card, board 5 (spec/shop.md, tile composition round 5): on a set-colour tile (--st-tile-<set>,
  board-5 medians) the set's approved package box sits at the left with a stack of loose nails from the set's sprite in
  the right-hand column (snippet st-pack-art, shared with the bag line items; this file holds the styles). Below:
  a red serif name (h3) with the live price at the right, and "View set →". Package art is the clean-edge derivative
  (st-package-<key>.webp, 1.3x variant in the srcset; never upscaled further, ≤380 css px). Price comes through
  Horizon's `price` snippet (Coming soon at 0); a sold-out badge shows when unavailable. The whole card is one link. The
  box alt is the product media's own alt (shared, SEO-033…039); the loose nails are decorative.

  @param {product} product - Product to show.
  @param {boolean} [eager] - Load the image eagerly (first row only).

  @example
  {% render 'st-product-card', product: product, eager: forloop.first %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign key = product.metafields.small_talk.campaign.value.system.handle
-%}

<article class="st-card" data-set="{{ key }}">
  <a class="st-card__link" href="{{ product.url }}">
    <span class="st-card__tile">
      {%- render 'st-pack-art', product: product, eager: eager -%}
      {%- unless product.available -%}
        <span class="st-card__badge">{{ 'small_talk.product.sold_out' | t }}</span>
      {%- endunless -%}
    </span>
    <div class="st-card__row">
      <h2 class="st-card__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</h2>
      <span class="st-card__price">{% render 'price', product_resource: product, trim_zeros: true %}</span>
    </div>
    <span class="st-card__cta"><span class="st-card__cta-text">{{ 'small_talk.product.view_set' | t }}</span> <span class="st-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
  </a>
</article>

{% stylesheet %}
  .st-card {
    --st-tile: var(--st-cream);
  }

  .st-card__link {
    display: grid;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .st-card__link:hover .st-card__pack {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .st-card__badge {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: 8px;
    inset-inline-end: 8px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--st-radius-pill);
    background: var(--st-paper);
    color: var(--st-price);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* Wraps only when the column is too narrow for name + price (e.g. "Brainwave" at 320 px): the price drops below. */
  .st-card__row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-block-start: 6px; /* board: name baseline ~191 px below the tile top */
  }

  /* Names and prices: bold condensed sans (tokens round 6, --font-card-name; prices match per shop acceptance 2). */
  .st-card__title {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--st-red);
    font-family: var(--font-card-name);
    font-weight: var(--fw-card-name, 700);
    font-size: var(--fs-card-name, 21px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: var(--ls-card-name, 0);
  }

  .st-card__price {
    flex: none;
    color: var(--color-price, var(--st-price));
    font-family: var(--font-price);
    font-weight: var(--fw-price, 700);
    font-size: var(--fs-price-card, 17px);
  }

  .st-card__price .price,
  .st-card__price * {
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
  }

  .st-card__cta {
    justify-self: start;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-block-start: 4px; /* the whole card is the link, so this line needs no own hit area */
    color: #4e6dcd;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .st-card__cta-text {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .st-card__link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--st-pill);
    outline-offset: 3px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
